# Pocketless

Coworker in **their** Google Meet. Silent until “Pocketless, …”. Memory is people + promises. We do not host the call.

## Hackathon (by 30 Sep 2026)

Ship: paste Meet URL → Recall bot joins, You/Them/Pocketless observer lanes, wake-name gating, seeded Priya, post-session brief on the person card, Talk-to-Pocketless.

Do not ship: hosted WebRTC room, Zoom/Teams bots, companion, Polar, MagSafe, 12 OAuth integrations.

## After hackathon

See `docs/after-hackathon.md`. Zoom/Teams adapters, companion, RevenueCat.

## UX

- Home = roster, not recordings.
- Transcript one click down on an episode.
- Humans stay in Google Meet. Dashboard is an observer.
